 n - see source for the mechanism. | North Carolina partnership return due t
 he 15th day of the 4th month after year-end. Extension length not numerical
 ly confirmed this session - see source for the mechanism. File Form D-410P 
 by the original due date if no automatic federal extension was obtained. | 
 Authority: North Carolina Department of Revenue\, direct fetch this session
